Build a complete, production-ready MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, Node.js, React.js) 
full-stack web application — an "Admin-Controlled Dynamic Portfolio Website." 
This must be a fully functional project with zero placeholder code. 
Every feature described below must be implemented end-to-end.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PROJECT OVERVIEW
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The portfolio homepage is a blank shell — it has NO hardcoded content. 
ALL content (name, bio, photos, experience, skills, videos, locations, 
navbar links, etc.) is stored in MongoDB and fetched via REST APIs.

The admin (portfolio owner) logs in from a small hidden link in the footer 
("⚙" icon, very subtle, opacity 0.3) and gets access to a full Admin Panel 
where they control every single section of the homepage.

This system must be 100% universal — someone can clone it, set their own 
.env variables, register their admin account on first visit, and have a 
fully working personal portfolio controlled entirely from the admin panel. 
No code changes needed — only admin panel inputs.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
TECH STACK
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Frontend:
- React.js (Vite)
- React Router DOM v6
- Axios (API calls)
- Three.js + @react-three/fiber + @react-three/drei (3D sections)
- Framer Motion (all page animations)
- react-google-maps/api (location map section)
- react-beautiful-dnd (drag-to-reorder in admin)
- react-quill (rich text editor for bio)
- react-hook-form (all forms)
- react-toastify (notifications)
- Tailwind CSS (styling)
- Google Fonts (use "Syne" for headings, "DM Sans" for body — import via @import in CSS)

Backend:
- Node.js + Express.js
- MongoDB + Mongoose
- JWT (jsonwebtoken) — stored in httpOnly cookie
- bcryptjs (password hashing)
- Multer + Cloudinary (image/file uploads)
- multer-storage-cloudinary
- express-rate-limit (contact form spam protection)
- helmet + cors + morgan
- express-validator (input validation)
- dotenv

