═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
BACKEND — COMPLETE IMPLEMENTATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── server.js ──
- Express app setup
- Connect MongoDB via config/db.js
- helmet(), cors({ origin: process.env.CLIENT_URL, credentials: true })
- morgan('dev')
- express.json(), express.urlencoded()
- cookie-parser
- Mount all routes under /api/
- Global error handler middleware
- Listen on PORT from .env

── config/db.js ──
- mongoose.connect(process.env.MONGO_URI)
- Log success/failure

── config/cloudinary.js ──
- cloudinary.config({ cloud_name, api_key, api_secret from .env })
- Export cloudinary + multer-storage-cloudinary storage

── middleware/authMiddleware.js ──
- Verify JWT from httpOnly cookie (req.cookies.token)
- If invalid/missing → 401 Unauthorized
- Attach req.admin = decoded payload

── middleware/uploadMiddleware.js ──
- Multer instance using CloudinaryStorage
- uploadImage: single image
- uploadMultiple: up to 10 images
- uploadPDF: pdf only

── models/ (all Mongoose schemas with full fields) ──

Admin.js:
{
  email: { type: String, required, unique, lowercase },
  password: { type: String, required },  // bcrypt hashed
  createdAt: Date
}
Methods: comparePassword(plain) → bcrypt.compare

Navbar.js:
{
  brandName: { type: String, default: 'My Portfolio' },
  logoUrl: String,
  links: [{ label: String, href: String, order: Number, _id: false }],
  showSocials: { type: Boolean, default: true },
  socialLinks: {
    github: String, linkedin: String, twitter: String,
    instagram: String, youtube: String
  }
}

Hero.js:
{
  slides: [{
    imageUrl: String,
    caption: String,
    subCaption: String,
    ctaText: String,
    ctaLink: String,
    order: Number
  }],
  autoSlideInterval: { type: Number, default: 4 }
}

About.js:
{
  name: String,
  tagline: String,
  bio: String,           // HTML from rich text editor
  profilePhotoUrl: String,
  resumeUrl: String,
  yearsOfExperience: Number,
  projectsCompleted: Number,
  happyClients: Number
}

Skill.js:
{
  title: String,
  category: { type: String, enum: ['Frontend','Backend','Database','DevOps','Other'] },
  level: { type: String, enum: ['Beginner','Intermediate','Expert'] },
  icon: String,          // emoji or URL
  order: Number,
  connectedTo: [{ type: mongoose.Schema.Types.ObjectId, ref: 'Skill' }]
}

Experience.js:
{
  company: String,
  role: String,
  startDate: String,
  endDate: String,       // "Present" if current
  isCurrent: Boolean,
  description: String,
  logoUrl: String,
  techStack: [String],
  order: Number
}

Education.js:
{
  institution: String,
  degree: String,
  field: String,
  startYear: String,
  endYear: String,
  grade: String,
  logoUrl: String,
  certificateUrl: String,
  type: { type: String, enum: ['Degree','Certification','Course'] },
  order: Number
}

GalleryPhoto.js:
{
  imageUrl: String,
  caption: String,
  category: String,
  order: Number
}

YouTubeVideo.js:
{
  videoId: String,       // extracted from URL
  title: String,
  description: String,
  thumbnailUrl: String,  // auto: https://img.youtube.com/vi/{videoId}/hqdefault.jpg
  order: Number
}

Location.js:
{
  name: String,
  address: String,
  city: String,
  lat: Number,
  lng: Number,
  phone: String,
  email: String,
  isHeadOffice: Boolean,
  order: Number
}

Message.js:
{
  name: String,
  email: String,
  subject: String,
  message: String,
  isRead: { type: Boolean, default: false },
  createdAt: { type: Date, default: Date.now }
}

Project.js:
{
  title: String,
  description: String,
  imageUrl: String,
  liveUrl: String,
  githubUrl: String,
  techStack: [String],
  featured: Boolean,
  order: Number
}

Testimonial.js:
{
  name: String,
  role: String,
  company: String,
  photoUrl: String,
  text: String,
  rating: { type: Number, min: 1, max: 5 },
