}

SiteMeta.js:
{
  siteTitle: String,
  faviconUrl: String,
  primaryColor: { type: String, default: '#6366f1' },
  accentColor: { type: String, default: '#f59e0b' },
  metaDescription: String,
  googleMapsApiKey: String,
  maintenanceMode: { type: Boolean, default: false },
  contactFormEnabled: { type: Boolean, default: true },
  footerText: String,
  copyrightName: String
}

── routes/ ──

auth.js:
POST /api/auth/setup     → First-time admin registration (blocked if admin exists)
  - Body: { email, password, setupKey } — setupKey must match process.env.ADMIN_SETUP_KEY
  - Hash password → save Admin → return success
POST /api/auth/login     → Login
  - Validate email+password → bcrypt.compare → sign JWT → set httpOnly cookie (maxAge 7d)
POST /api/auth/logout    → Clear cookie
GET  /api/auth/me        → authMiddleware → return { email, id }

For ALL other sections, implement full CRUD:

GET    /api/<section>           → Public — find all, sort by order
POST   /api/<section>           → authMiddleware — create new document
PUT    /api/<section>/:id       → authMiddleware — findByIdAndUpdate
DELETE /api/<section>/:id       → authMiddleware — findByIdAndDelete
PUT    /api/<section>/reorder   → authMiddleware — bulk update order field

Special routes:
POST /api/messages               → Public — save visitor message (rate limited: 5/hour per IP)
GET  /api/messages               → authMiddleware — get all messages, sort by createdAt desc
PUT  /api/messages/:id/read      → authMiddleware — mark as read
GET  /api/messages/unread-count  → authMiddleware — return count of unread

POST /api/upload/image  → authMiddleware + uploadMiddleware.uploadImage → return { url }
POST /api/upload/images → authMiddleware + uploadMiddleware.uploadMultiple → return { urls: [] }
POST /api/upload/pdf    → authMiddleware + uploadMiddleware.uploadPDF → return { url }

GET  /api/sitemeta      → Public — return site meta
PUT  /api/sitemeta      → authMiddleware — update (upsert)

.env.example:
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://...
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_key_here
ADMIN_SETUP_KEY=setup1234
CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
FRONTEND — COMPLETE IMPLEMENTATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── utils/api.js ──
- Axios instance: baseURL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:5000/api'
- withCredentials: true (for httpOnly cookie)
- Request interceptor: log
- Response interceptor: if 401 → redirect to /admin/login

── context/AuthContext.jsx ──
- State: { admin, loading }
- checkAuth() on mount: GET /api/auth/me
- login(email, password): POST /api/auth/login → set admin state
- logout(): POST /api/auth/logout → clear admin state

── App.jsx ──
- BrowserRouter
- Routes:
  / → <Home />
  /admin/login → <AdminLogin /> (redirect to /admin if already logged in)
  /admin → <PrivateRoute><AdminDashboard /></PrivateRoute>
- PrivateRoute: checks AuthContext, redirects to /admin/login if not authenticated

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
HOMEPAGE DESIGN — UI/UX (FULLY ANIMATED)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Design direction: Dark theme with deep space aesthetic.
Background: #0a0a0f (near-black with slight blue tint)
Primary accent: pulled from SiteMeta.primaryColor (default indigo #6366f1)
Secondary accent: SiteMeta.accentColor (default amber #f59e0b)
Font: "Syne" (headings, weights 400/700/800), "DM Sans" (body, weights 300/400/500)
Import both from Google Fonts in index.css via @import

All homepage components must:
1. Use Framer Motion for entrance animations
2. Use useInView from framer-motion for scroll-triggered reveals  
3. Have smooth transitions between states
4. Show skeleton loaders while fetching data
5. Handle empty states gracefully (show placeholder if admin hasn't added content yet)

── Navbar.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/navbar on mount
- Fixed top, glassmorphism effect: backdrop-blur-md bg-black/40 border-b border-white/10
- Logo (image if logoUrl exists, else brandName text)
- Nav links from database — smooth scroll if href starts with #
- Social icons (github, linkedin etc.) from socialLinks — show only if showSocials=true
- Mobile: hamburger menu with slide-down drawer (Framer Motion AnimatePresence)
- Scroll behavior: hide on scroll down, show on scroll up (useScroll from framer-motion)
- Active link highlight with animated underline indicator

── HeroBanner.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/hero
- Full viewport height (100vh) slider
- Slides transition with Framer Motion (opacity + slight Y translate)
- Auto-advances every `autoSlideInterval` seconds
- Dot indicators at bottom
- Each slide: background image (cover), dark overlay, centered text
- Caption: huge font (Syne 700, clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem)), stagger-animated letter by letter
- SubCaption below: fade in after caption
- CTA button: glowing border button with hover fill animation
- Subtle particle effect background using Three.js (floating dots, slow drift)
- Progress bar at bottom showing slide timing

── About.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/about
- Two-column layout: left = profile photo, right = text
- Profile photo: circular, glowing ring animation (CSS keyframe pulsing border)
- Name: large Syne heading
- Tagline: gradient text (indigo → amber)
- Bio: render HTML from react-quill output
- 3 stat counters: yearsOfExperience, projectsCompleted, happyClients
  → Animated number count-up on scroll-into-view (custom useCountUp hook)
- Resume download button (links to resumeUrl from DB)
- Entrance: left side slides from left, right side slides from right

── Skills3D.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/skills
- Three.js canvas (full section width, 600px height)
- Each skill = a floating 3D node (RoundedBox mesh from drei)
- Nodes colored by category (Frontend=indigo, Backend=emerald, Database=amber, etc.)
- Nodes connected by animated lines (THREE.Line with dashed material)
- Nodes slowly rotate and float (sine wave Y animation in useFrame)
- Click on node: shows tooltip card with skill title, level, category
- OrbitControls for user interaction (zoom + rotate)
- Camera auto-rotates slowly when user not interacting
- Below the 3D canvas: skill category filter pills 
  → clicking a category highlights only those nodes
- Level badge on each node (Beginner/Intermediate/Expert) rendered as HTML overlay via drei <Html>

── Experience3D.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/experience
- Three.js horizontal timeline
- Central axis line running left to right
- Each job = floating card node above/below the axis, alternating
- Card nodes: white-border boxes rendered with drei <Html> — show company, role, duration
- Camera smoothly pans left-to-right as user scrolls down (useScroll from @react-three/drei)
- Active node (near camera center): expands to show full description, techStack tags
- TechStack tags: pill badges in accent color
- Timeline dots on axis pulse gently
- isCurrent job: glowing green dot + "Present" badge
- Below canvas (non-3D): same experience as horizontal cards for mobile fallback

── Education.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/education
- Two tabs: "Education" and "Certifications" (filter by type field)
- Staggered card grid (Framer Motion stagger children)
- Each card: institution logo, degree, field, year range, grade badge
- Certification card: certificate image thumbnail, click to open full image modal
- Cards hover: lift + border glow

── Gallery.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/gallery
- Masonry grid layout (CSS columns: 3, gap: 1rem)
- Category filter pills above (All + unique categories from DB)
- Framer Motion layout animations when filtering (AnimatePresence + layout prop)
- Each photo: hover → slight scale + overlay with caption
- Click → lightbox modal (full screen image, prev/next navigation, close on ESC)
- Lazy loading with loading="lazy" + blur placeholder

── YouTubeSection.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/youtube
- Section heading: "Watch My Content" (or customizable via SiteMeta)
- Horizontal scrollable card row (overflow-x: auto, custom scrollbar)
- Each card: YouTube thumbnail image, video title, description (truncated)
- Hover: card lifts + play button overlay appears
- Click: opens YouTube in new tab (no embed, just link via videoId)
- Cards animate in with stagger from left

── LocationMap.jsx ──
- Fetches /api/locations
- Google Maps (react-google-maps/api) centered on first/head office
- Custom dark map style (google maps dark theme JSON)
- Each location = custom marker pin (animated bounce on load)
- Click marker → InfoWindow with name, address, phone, email
- isHeadOffice location: different colored marker (amber vs indigo)
- Left sidebar: list of all locations as cards
  → Click card → map pans to that location (panTo animation)
  → Active card highlighted
- Google Maps API key read from SiteMeta.googleMapsApiKey

── ContactForm.jsx ──
- Only renders if SiteMeta.contactFormEnabled = true
- react-hook-form with full validation
- Fields: name (required), email (required, valid email), subject (required), message (required, min 20 chars)
- POST /api/messages on submit
- Success: confetti burst (canvas-confetti library) + success toast
- Error: error toast
- Input fields: dark glassmorphism style with focus glow
- Submit button: animated gradient background on hover
- Rate limiting handled server-side (feedback to user if too many requests)

── Footer.jsx ──
- Simple dark footer
- Copyright text from SiteMeta.copyrightName or footerText
- Social links row
- "⚙" admin login link: opacity-30, very small, bottom right — links to /admin/login
- Animated border-top gradient line

